  "body": "Once (1/6) through (5/6) have landed, delete the column engine (`dexel*.rs` and its column-only kernels), the `Backend::Column` / `Stock::Column` arm and the engine-comparison suites (`stock_backend_parity`, `stock_engine_agreement`). Port the tests that used Column as a baseline (about 12 files) to the field engine, and close the open-questions note.\n\nPart of #26 (retire the column engine). Research and consumer map: https://github.com/NeoTech/Camcraft/issues/26#issuecomment-6754685656\n\nThe step is behaviour-neutral: `stock_engine_agreement` and the goldens stay byte-identical where verdicts are.\n\nDone means: One retirement commit. Goldens are byte-comparable where verdicts are, and the `#[test]` count is accounted for: retired comparison tests listed, ported tests kept.\n",
